{"id":"n26087-1-45","stage":1,"title":"경험 · 经验","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26087-1-45-1","ko":"여행은 잘 다녀왔어?","zh":"旅行玩得还顺利吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여행은","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녀왔어?","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5215fdf88ea73d4d7201.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26087-1-45-2","ko":"응, 여기저기 다니면서 정말 많은 경험을 하고 돌아왔어.","zh":"嗯，到处逛了逛，积累了好多经验才回来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기저기","meaning":"到处，这里那里","explanation":"여기저기：到处，这里那里","readings":[{"term":"여기저기","audio":"/audio/9e2ef8f34a6bbf710011.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70994","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다니면서","meaning":"来往，走遍，","explanation":"다니다：来往，走遍，；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"4","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"경험을","meaning":"经验","explanation":"경험：经验；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"경험","audio":"/audio/340b9a0fcd5fc1d6bfa3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26087","senseId":"1","lemma":"경험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"经历、体验（경험을 하다）","explanation":"하다：经历、体验（경험을 하다）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌아왔어.","meaning":"回，回来，归来","explanation":"돌아오다：回，回来，归来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"돌아오다","audio":"/audio/cfe0233d2be88a8338fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66268","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌아오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"9e2ef8f34a6bbf71","term":"여기저기","zh":"到处，这里那里","audio":"/audio/9e2ef8f34a6bbf710011.mp3","entryId":"70994","definition":"没有明确定下的多个场所或位置。","pronunciation":["여기저기"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"来往，走遍，","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"到处走动。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"340b9a0fcd5fc1d6","term":"경험","zh":"经验","audio":"/audio/340b9a0fcd5fc1d6bfa3.mp3","entryId":"26087","definition":"自己实际做过或经历过；或指从中获得的知识或技能。","pronunciation":["경험"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"经历、体验（경험을 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"经历、体验（경험을 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"cfe0233d2be88a83","term":"돌아오다","zh":"回，回来，归来","audio":"/audio/cfe0233d2be88a8338fd.mp3","entryId":"66268","definition":"返回原地或恢复原状。","pronunciation":["도라오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/afdd40dd8598b564b6e2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26087","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.7334,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，到处逛了逛，积累了好多经验才回来的。","哎呀，姐姐你也已经有白头发了呀？","旅行玩得还顺利吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯，到处逛了逛，积累了好多经验才回来的。","旅行玩得还顺利吗？","哎呀，姐姐你也已经有白头发了呀？"],"answer":0}]}
